For a brief moment horrific hairs grow on your head, each of them ending with a creepy eye.

You use those eyes to gaze upon a target area, creatures caught inside partially turn to stone reducing their movement speed by [-4%, 32%, 49%, 58%, 64% (TL1-5)] and making them brittle for 7 turns.

Brittle targets have a 35% chance for any damage they take to be increased by [30%, 40%, 47%, 54%, 60% (TL1-5)].

This cannot be saved against.
